<title>FRANCE: EU grants free-mkt soft wheat - traders.</title>
<headline>EU grants free-mkt soft wheat - traders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday granted licences to export around 91,000 tonnes of free-market soft wheat to non-EU countries at a maximum rebate of 7.49 Ecus per tonne, grain traders said.</p>
</text>
